# 9. USB Detection

The first version can use Android USB debugging + ADB.

Android requires USB debugging to be enabled for ADB communication over USB.

The Mac application can detect:

```text
adb devices
```

Expected:

```text
XXXXXXXXXXXX    device
```

If the state is:

```text
unauthorized
```

