# 15. Extended Display Architecture

The desired architecture:

```text
macOS
   |
   | Virtual Display
   ↓
One+Connect Display
   |
   | ScreenCaptureKit
   ↓
Video frames
   |
   | VideoToolbox
   ↓
H.264
   |
   | USB
   ↓
Android
   |
   | MediaCodec
   ↓
SurfaceView
   |
   ↓
OnePlus display
```

The virtual display is the most technically sensitive component.

Existing virtual-display implementations use the private `CGVirtualDisplay` family of APIs. There is no straightforward public API for simply creating an arbitrary virtual monitor.

Therefore the PRD should explicitly treat this as a high-risk component.

