# 29. Touch Coordinate Mapping

The tablet sends normalized coordinates.

Instead of:

```text
x = 1732
y = 924
```

send:

```text
x = 0.618
y = 0.467
```

Mac converts that into display coordinates.

Advantages:

* resolution independent
* orientation independent
* scaling independent
* works across display modes

