# 68. macOS Distribution Strategy

This is an important product decision.

If the implementation depends on private `CGVirtualDisplay` APIs, Mac App Store distribution becomes problematic. Existing open-source virtual-display projects explicitly document this limitation.

Therefore initial distribution should likely be:

```text
Signed
+
Notarized
+
Direct DMG download
```

rather than Mac App Store.

Long-term, investigate a supported DriverKit architecture.

