# 83. Engineering Priority

The order I would personally follow is:

**#1 — Prove USB transport**

**#2 — Prove Mac → Android H.264 at 60 FPS**

**#3 — Prove touch → Mac**

**#4 — Prove virtual display**

**#5 — Combine them**

**#6 — Optimize**

**#7 — Add 120 Hz / native resolution / stylus / audio**

Do **not** spend weeks polishing the splash screen before #1–#4 are proven.

The beautiful UI is relatively easy.

The actual product-defining engineering is:

```text
Virtual Display
       +
Low-latency Video
       +
USB Transport
       +
Touch Input
```

That is the One+Connect core.
